r"><name><surname>Shingu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Terasaki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Okamoto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Goto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurumiya</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Natsume</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A case of gastrointestinal stromal tumor(GIST) of the omentum</article-title><source>Journal of Japan Surgical association</source><year>2003</year><volume>64</volume><fpage>1246</fpage><lpage>50</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>